#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0403 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "Row 3's ATOXDSCL is blank. A blank TARGET is the D.2 emptiness exception: neither counted toward the group's distinct values nor ever flagged, so the (001, GLUC) group is left with one distinct value and nothing fires; independently row 3's own not empty(ATOXDSCL) conjunct is false. Pins the blank-TARGET exception."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PARAMCD  type=Char
col AVISITN  type=Num
col AVAL     type=Num
col ATOXDSCL type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | GLUC | 1 | 5.0 | GRADE1
S1 | 001 | GLUC | 2 | 5.1 | GRADE1
S1 | 001 | GLUC | 3 | 5.2 |
